{
  "name": "popover",
  "title": "气泡卡片",
  "titleEn": "Popover",
  "category": "data",
  "summary": "点击触发的浮层卡片，可放任意内容（文字、链接、按钮、表单），点外部或按 Esc 关闭。",
  "when": "需要在原地展示补充信息或少量操作。只有一句提示用 tooltip；操作菜单用 dropdown；需要用户专注完成任务用 dialog。",
  "root": "riko-popover",
  "element": "div",
  "parts": [
    {
      "class": "riko-popover__header",
      "desc": "标题行"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-popover__title",
      "desc": "标题"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-popover__close",
      "desc": "关闭按钮（加 data-riko-close 与 aria-label）"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-popover__body",
      "desc": "内容"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-popover__footer",
      "desc": "底部操作区"
    }
  ],
  "modifiers": [
    {
      "class": "riko-popover--sm",
      "desc": "窄（220px）",
      "group": "size"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-popover--lg",
      "desc": "宽（400px）",
      "group": "size"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-popover--ice",
      "desc": "冰蓝底",
      "group": "tone"
    }
  ],
  "states": [
    {
      "attr": "aria-expanded=\"true\"",
      "on": "触发器",
      "desc": "打开时由 JS 维护"
    }
  ],
  "js": {
    "attr": "data-riko=\"popover\"",
    "options": [
      {
        "attr": "data-riko-toggle=\"<popover id>\"",
        "values": "popover 的 id",
        "desc": "写在触发按钮上：点击切换"
      },
      {
        "attr": "popover",
        "values": "auto",
        "desc": "原生属性，写在 popover 上（推荐手写，避免首屏闪现）"
      },
      {
        "attr": "data-riko-placement",
        "values": "bottom | top | left | right（可加 -start / -end）",
        "default": "bottom",
        "desc": "写在 popover 上：相对触发器的位置"
      },
      {
        "attr": "data-riko-close",
        "values": "",
        "desc": "写在 popover 内的按钮上：点击关闭"
      }
    ],
    "methods": [
      {
        "signature": "pop.riko.open(anchor?) / pop.riko.close() / pop.riko.toggle(anchor?)",
        "desc": "手动控制；anchor 为定位参照元素"
      }
    ],
    "events": [
      {
        "name": "riko:popover:open",
        "detail": "{ anchor }",
        "desc": "打开后"
      },
      {
        "name": "riko:popover:close",
        "detail": "{ anchor }",
        "desc": "关闭后"
      }
    ]
  },
  "a11y": [
    "触发器用 <button>；JS 会设置 aria-expanded / aria-controls / aria-haspopup。",
    "打开后焦点移入卡片（第一个可聚焦元素，没有则卡片本身），Esc 关闭并把焦点还给触发器。",
    "有标题时给 popover 加 aria-labelledby 指向标题 id。"
  ],
  "rules": [
    "popover 元素可以放在页面任何位置（通常放在触发器旁边或 body 末尾），它会在顶层渲染。",
    "关闭按钮：<button class=\"riko-popover__close\" data-riko-close aria-label=\"关闭\"></button>。"
  ],
  "avoid": [
    "不要用 popover 做必须完成的流程（改用 dialog）。",
    "不要给触发器同时加 popovertarget 和 data-riko-toggle。"
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "基础用法",
      "html": "<div class=\"riko-cluster riko-cluster--center\">\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"riko-btn riko-btn--soft\" data-riko-toggle=\"pop-riko\">关于络可</button>\n  <div class=\"riko-popover\" id=\"pop-riko\" data-riko=\"popover\" popover aria-labelledby=\"pop-riko-title\">\n    <div class=\"riko-popover__header\">\n      <h3 class=\"riko-popover__title\" id=\"pop-riko-title\"><span class=\"riko-star\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>络可</h3>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"riko-popover__close\" data-riko-close aria-label=\"关闭\"></button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"riko-popover__body\">自小在 HV 长大的小画家，戴着有星星的贝雷帽，最喜欢在沙滩上画海。</div>\n    <div class=\"riko-popover__footer\">\n      <a class=\"riko-btn riko-btn--sm riko-btn--primary\" href=\"#popover\">查看设定</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"riko-btn\" data-riko-toggle=\"pop-tip\">小提示</button>\n  <div class=\"riko-popover riko-popover--sm riko-popover--ice\" id=\"pop-tip\" data-riko=\"popover\" popover data-riko-placement=\"top\">\n    <div class=\"riko-popover__body\">按 ← → 可以切换小节哦 ✦</div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
    }
  ],
  "requires": [
    {
      "selector": ".riko-popover",
      "attr": "id",
      "message": "riko-popover 需要 id，供触发器的 data-riko-toggle 引用"
    },
    {
      "selector": ".riko-popover",
      "attr": "popover",
      "message": "riko-popover 建议写上 popover 属性（避免页面加载时闪现）"
    },
    {
      "selector": ".riko-popover__close",
      "attr": "aria-label",
      "message": "riko-popover__close 需要 aria-label"
    }
  ],
  "related": [
    "tooltip",
    "dropdown",
    "dialog"
  ]
}
